    },
    { "type": "heading", "inlines": ["Welcome"] },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inlines": [
        "This handbook describes how we work: hours, holidays, travel and expenses. Questions go to ",
        { "link": "mailto:hr@example.com", "inlines": ["hr@example.com"] },
        ". The forms are in ",
        { "link": "#forms", "inlines": ["the appendix"] },
        "."
      ]
    },
    { "type": "heading", "level": 2, "inlines": ["Working hours"] },
    { "type": "paragraph", "inlines": ["Core hours are 09:00 to 15:00. Outside them, plan your day with your team and record your hours in the time sheet every Friday."] },
    { "type": "heading", "level": 2, "inlines": ["Holidays"] },
    { "type": "paragraph", "inlines": ["Everyone has 25 working days of holiday a year. Ask for three weeks in the summer by 1 April, and for other days two weeks ahead."] },
    { "type": "pageBreak" },
    { "type": "heading", "inlines": ["Travel and expenses"] },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inlines": [
        "Book travel through the agency and keep every receipt. The rates follow the ",
        { "link": "https://example.com/rates", "inlines": ["state travel rates"], "description": "The state travel rates on example.com" },
        "."
      ]
    },
    { "type": "heading", "level": 2, "inlines": ["Mileage"] },
    { "type": "paragraph", "inlines": ["Driving your own car is paid per kilometre at the state rate. Note the start, the end and the purpose of each trip."] },
    {
      "type": "sectionBreak",
      "prefix": "A-",
      "startAt": 1,
      "header": { "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "align": "right", "inlines": ["Appendix"] }] }
